+- No frontend route or public client integration is included.
+
+## Security Translation
+
+- Keep B1 views in a private or otherwise non-exposed schema unless a later human-approved production issue explicitly changes that boundary.
+- For Postgres 15 or newer, keep contract views as \`security_invoker = true\` so underlying table policies remain effective for the caller.
+- Keep RPC functions \`SECURITY INVOKER\` by default. Do not introduce \`SECURITY DEFINER\` for these query surfaces without a separate threat model and approval.
